  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Irish Aid, SEHLAC Project Grant,</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to enhance strategies that prevent violence and femicides through public awareness and the deconstruction of myths associated with the possession of firearms in the home as a personal protection factor. To this end, the project will generate data that will contribute to understand and deepen the analysis of the problem. It will also design appropriate messages that create alerts about the impact of firearms in the home with the lethality of cases of gender-based violence.</narrative>
  </description>
